4. Host chrome is not this product
The preview frame is separate packaging. It is not part of the
RECRUIT4US grant and it is not licensed by this file. That material
includes the public/__grok directory, the scripts named grok-pwa-*,
the document injector that adds host tags, and the silent preview
bridge. Those files stay so a host can frame the app. They do not make
the host's marks part of RECRUIT4US, and this license does not grant
the host's marks.

